Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||05-04-2001||03:28 PM||||My 85 SE is light grey, and I noticed it looks similar in shape to a delorean, and since i have seen Back to the Future III over a hundred times (it use to run continiously in a video projector demo room where I previously worked) I was thinking<P>  wouldnt it be great to do a Back 2 da Future number on a grey/silver Fiero? Put the flux capacitor right there between the seats, the 'time controls' up on the dash (could be rigged as digtal dashboard - functional) and whatever other parts you felt like putting onthe outside/reardeck to make it look like the movie car.<P>   that would sure turn heads!||||reg||1
