Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||05-05-2001||01:44 AM||||I still think gullwings would be possible on a Fiero... and if anyone who has an extra car with t-tops, in any condition (it's gonna get cut up a bit anyway), I'd be more than happy to donate some time and technical ability to work on this.. who knows, might even end up with a kit to sell...<P>(the gullwings, not the BTTF car. hehe.. it'd be cool, but not a big market for it I think)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
