Z||000008||Spektyr||05-05-2001||06:24 AM||||I've wanted a Delorean since I saw that movie, there's just no way I could afford to buy it.<P>I've bitten off more than enough to keep me busy building up my 85GT, the Delorean would keep me bankrupt for many years.<P><I>sigh</I>  I shoulda been born rich...<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||1
