Z||000010||Ken Wittlief||05-07-2001||02:41 PM||||the guy that was arrested driving a Delorean... most likely cause he stole it!<P>they are rare enought that most people dont even take them out of the garage anymore, much less do anything that would warrent your arrest!<P>I noticed I am getting use to my frameless door windows really quickly, I almost put my face into the door wind frame on my wifes Saturn this weekend. Making gullwing doors out of the frameless fiero doors would be really cool, esp with the power windows - you could put the doors up then roll the power windows up and down and watch the doors extend and retract  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  BTW I also noticed if I close my door with the window half way down it makes an ungodly cluck! With the window all the way up or down it closes nicely. I guess I just shouldnt do that anymore. Anything that clunks that loud can be good for something in there.||||reg||1
